  "Regulators have moved from asking for frameworks to asking for names. Most organisations are still offering committee structures.",
  "Broken governance does not slow AI down. It accelerates the failure.",
  "A name on a register is not ownership. Ownership is explicit acceptance of accountability for decisions, backed by authority to act.",
  "Oversight without authority is observation.",
  "Accountability without authority is blame. Authority without accountability is power. Governance requires both, held by the same person.",
