  "Speed without governance is just a shorter path to a crash.",
  "Quality is not a percentage. It is whether the data is safe to use for this decision, in this process, at this level of consequence.",
  "Perpetual acceptance is not governance. It is neglect with a signature.",
  "An organisation that cannot govern data on a whiteboard will not govern it in a platform.",
  "A model that is 98% accurate and systematically harmful is not a success with a minor flaw. It is a liability with a high confidence score.",
  "A constraint in a prompt is a suggestion. A constraint in the infrastructure is a control.",
